# A build made from the slate, on the machine the game is built on: the builds page
# of dev mode makes the playtest configuration's web build in the background (asked
# twice when another session keeps the machine busy), tails the export, and the
# stamped build comes onto the shelf with what it was made from.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/dev-builds.tour --seed=1 --hour=10 --weather=clear:0 --config=playtest --dev=builds
await app:dev 20
coast calm
wait 0.5
shot 01-builds-page
choose make
tap use
wait 0.3
# A busy machine asks again; on a quiet one this second press finds the job running.
tap use
await dev_job:done 600
await dev_job:ok 1
wait 2.5
shot 02-made-and-on-the-shelf
choose build:web
tap use
wait 0.4
shot 03-the-build
tap pause
wait 0.2
tap dev_toggle
await app:none 5
